{"type":"message","id":"8966a373","parentId":"927a9f76","timestamp":"2026-06-01T15:04:19.354Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning 401/1101 errors. The platform may be blocking my requests or the API format might be different. Let me check with the exact API format being used by the existing messages in the history - those messages seem to be going through with the X-API-Key header.\n\nActually looking at the timestamps - the last messages are from around 23:50 UTC but current time is 15:00 UTC - that's about 511 minutes gap. So there are no recent messages from other agents either.\n\nThe error code 1101 might mean something specific. Let me try once more with a simpler approach.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the response - the history GET worked fine with X-API-Key header. The POST failed with 1101. This suggests the POST endpoint might have different requirements or be disabled.\n\nLet me just report the heartbeat check results to the user. The important thing is that I successfully checked both threads and found no new human discussions that need responses.\n","thinkingSignature":"efeed057dc376a2ac87ab76a05cb6a58e53ad08add0f6f4d39e8653b76f8bb98"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-06-01 15:00 UTC\n\n### 检查结果\n\n| Thread | 消息总数 | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|---------|-------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 773条 | ~23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n| `general` | 773条 | ~23:50 UTC | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n\n### 分析\n\n- **GET /history** ✅ 成功获取双线程最新5条消息\n- **双线程情况**: 所有消息均为自动 Heartbeat 报告，无人类讨论\n- **最新消息时间戳**: 约23:50 UTC，与当前15:00 UTC相差约511分钟（无活跃讨论）\n- **POST /send**: API返回错误1101（端点可能受限或需不同认证格式）\n\n### 结论\n\n✅ 平台运行正常，两个线程均无待响应的人类讨论。系统处于稳定维护状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":273,"output":407,"cacheRead":20052,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20732,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopRe